			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741920101,
					"content": "我看见：王座上的火焰已经熄灭，烧却的灰烬重新变成了树。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741920102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏诺蒂拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741920102,
					"content": "花朵随着你的脚步绽放，你能给必然颓败的未来带来变化。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741920103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏诺蒂拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741920103,
					"content": "夏诺蒂拉？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741920104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741920104,
					"content": "#咦，原来是{NICKNAME}{M#哥哥}{F#姐姐}！你怎么会在这里？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741920105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏诺蒂拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741920105,
					"content": "啊，对了！金色的蝴蝶已经回来了，要赶紧去看看才行！再见啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "夏诺蒂拉"
				}
			]
		},
